---
// Layout and artwork transcribed from the rendered x.ai/bot page.
---

<section id="pricing">
  <div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[var(--site-content-width)] flex-col gap-10 px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-center">
        Self-hosted &amp; BYOK
      </h2>
      <p class="text-theme-text-muted max-w-2xl text-center text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty sm:text-lg">
        Miko is a self-hosted coding agent. You run the worker on your machine or server, and model usage stays on your account.
      </p>

    </div>
    <div class="flex w-full flex-col items-center gap-4">
      <div class="grid w-full max-w-5xl gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="bg-card flex flex-col rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><h3 class="text-secondary text-sm font-medium">Your agent</h3></div><p class="mt-3 flex min-w-0 items-baseline gap-1.5"><span class="font-display shrink-0 text-4xl tracking-tight">Choose</span><span class="text-secondary min-w-0 truncate text-sm">your runner</span></p><p class="text-secondary mt-1 text-sm">Use the coding agent that fits your work.</p><p class="mt-8 text-sm">Includes:</p><ul class="col-start-1 row-start-1 mt-3 grid content-start gap-2.5"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Grok</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Gemini and OpenCode</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Repository-level configuration</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Provider-specific model selection</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Your existing coding workflow</span></li></ul></article>
        <article class="bg-card flex flex-col rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><h3 class="text-secondary text-sm font-medium">Your credentials</h3></div><p class="mt-3 flex min-w-0 items-baseline gap-1.5"><span class="font-display shrink-0 text-4xl tracking-tight">BYOK</span><span class="text-secondary min-w-0 truncate text-sm">your account</span></p><p class="text-secondary mt-1 text-sm">Model usage stays with your provider.</p><p class="mt-8 text-sm">Includes:</p><ul class="col-start-1 row-start-1 mt-3 grid content-start gap-2.5"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Supported API keys or subscriptions</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Your provider’s usage limits</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>No bundled token allowance</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Your account and billing</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Provider authentication required</span></li></ul></article>
        <article class="bg-card flex flex-col rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><h3 class="text-secondary text-sm font-medium">Your infrastructure</h3></div><p class="mt-3 flex min-w-0 items-baseline gap-1.5"><span class="font-display shrink-0 text-4xl tracking-tight">Local</span><span class="text-secondary min-w-0 truncate text-sm">your machine</span></p><p class="text-secondary mt-1 text-sm">Run the worker on your own machine or server.</p><p class="mt-8 text-sm">Includes:</p><ul class="col-start-1 row-start-1 mt-3 grid content-start gap-2.5"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Apache 2.0 source</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Isolated Git worktrees</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Repository routing</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Local status board and history</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span>Searchable task logs</span></li></ul></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
